{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103657","id":2374786421,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6NjF11","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103657","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103657.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103657.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103657","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103657/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103657/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103657/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f501a02f48bba5a81731e1015833a1902f4dbfa5","number":103657,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add automatic C# build on editor focus","user":{"login":"RobProductions","id":11141862,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTQxODYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11141862?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobProductions","html_url":"https://github.com/RobProductions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobProductions/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobProductions/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobProductions/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobProductions/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobProductions/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobProductions/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobProductions/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobProductions/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobProductions/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2920\r\n\r\nThis PR aims to improve the usability of C# with an external IDE by automatically building the Mono project when Godot is focused and only if the CS files have changed. A new editor setting called `build_on_focus` which is disabled by default allows you toggle this feature on or off:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/973b9198-37a0-41e1-9fe3-1f93eb22b432)\r\n\r\nThanks to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/93431 which also had to solve the problem of detecting when CS files have changed, I was able to repurpose a snippet of that code and hook into the existing `HotReloadAssemblyWatcher` which can detect when the Godot Editor is focused in order to build the project at the correct time. Here's that in action:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9baabafa-9903-4356-a29a-cfdfc16c2c2a\r\n\r\nAnother idea that could stem off of this would be automatically building the C# project when saving through the built in script editor, but that could get more annoying if you make changes to a lot of files, so if we were to tackle it, I believe it should be its own editor setting and its own PR. Plus, it seems like many C# users prefer to work with an IDE like Visual Studio and this functionality seems more relevant for them especially since its a familiar feature to other game engines.\r\n\r\nLet me know if it all looks good, thanks!","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.